":"布与暹奉书劝共击术暹奉回计从布","evidence":["lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-a3c37ba6537e6e75a991","label":"裴注·九州春秋","text":"布进军暹奉兵并发大破勋军","evidence":["lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"问珪今致术军卿之由也为之奈何、用珪策遣人说暹奉使与己并力共击术军、军资所有悉许暹奉；与暹奉书曰二将军拔大驾来东有元功于国当书勋竹帛万世不朽今袁术造逆当共诛讨奈何与贼臣还共伐布布有杀董卓之功与二将军俱为功臣可因今共击破术建功于天下此时不可失也；进军去勋等营百步","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c","lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0039","role":"答暹奉与术猝合之军耳策谋不素定不能相维持、子登策之比之连鸡势不俱栖可解离也","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140"]},{"person":"wudi-p0121","role":"从布并力共击术军；得书即回计从布；兵同时并发","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c","lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0120","role":"从布并力共击术军；得书即回计从布；兵同时并发","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c","lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0042","role":"大破败；营被攻、将十将被斩、杀伤堕水死者不可胜数","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c","lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9"]},"ordering_evidence":"lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","source_order":[7,96,22],"order":1835},{"id":"fangji-e-1b67ee2bfd66c304829f","title":"沛相陈珪举华佗孝廉、太尉黄琬辟之，皆不就","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-1b67ee2bfd66c304829f","label":"正文","text":"沛相陈珪举华佗孝廉、太尉黄琬辟之，皆不就","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongyuan-p0039","role":"举孝廉者","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0071","role":"辟者","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]},{"person":"wudi-p0407","role":"被举辟而不就者","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc","order":5864}],"persons":[{"id":"dongyuan-p0039","name":"陈珪","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o073","lvzang-q-b28024c27d38f4099607","lvzang-q-98215ad785aa14260dec","lvzang-q-506be56448dd0eb5ba0f","lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-o073-dongyuan-p0039","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o073"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o074-dongyuan-p0039","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o074"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o073a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-e6baa7c37f2b8d81088f","layer":"original","quote":"时沛相下邳陈珪〖2〗，故太尉球弟子也〖3〗。术与珪俱公族子孙〖4〗，少共交游。书与珪曰：“昔秦失其政，天下群雄，争而取之，兼智勇者卒受其归〖5〗。今世事纷扰，复有瓦解之势矣；诚英乂有为之时也〖6〗。与足下旧交，岂肯左右之乎？若集大事，子实为吾心膂〖7〗。”珪中子应，时在下邳；术并胁质应，图必致珪。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o074a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-39a40a126fa53840c495","layer":"original","quote":"珪答书曰：“昔秦末世，肆暴恣情，虐流天下，毒被生民；下不堪命，故遂土崩。今虽季世〖8〗，未有亡秦苛暴之乱也。曹将军神武应期〖9〗，兴复典刑〖10〗；将拨平凶慝〖11〗，清定海内：信有征矣〖12〗。以为足下当戮力同心〖13〗，匡翼汉室；而阴谋不轨〖14〗，以身试祸：岂不痛哉！若迷而知反，尚可以免。吾备旧知〖15〗，故陈至情；虽逆于耳，骨肉之惠也〖16〗。欲吾营私阿附，有犯死不能也！”","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":192,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o073","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-e6baa7c37f2b8d81088f","layer":"original","quote":"时沛相下邳陈珪〖2〗，故太尉球弟子也〖3〗。术与珪俱公族子孙〖4〗，少共交游。书与珪曰：“昔秦失其政，天下群雄，争而取之，兼智勇者卒受其归〖5〗。今世事纷扰，复有瓦解之势矣；诚英乂有为之时也〖6〗。与足下旧交，岂肯左右之乎？若集大事，子实为吾心膂〖7〗。”珪中子应，时在下邳；术并胁质应，图必致珪。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o074","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-39a40a126fa53840c495","layer":"original","quote":"珪答书曰：“昔秦末世，肆暴恣情，虐流天下，毒被生民；下不堪命，故遂土崩。今虽季世〖8〗，未有亡秦苛暴之乱也。曹将军神武应期〖9〗，兴复典刑〖10〗；将拨平凶慝〖11〗，清定海内：信有征矣〖12〗。以为足下当戮力同心〖13〗，匡翼汉室；而阴谋不轨〖14〗，以身试祸：岂不痛哉！若迷而知反，尚可以免。吾备旧知〖15〗，故陈至情；虽逆于耳，骨肉之惠也〖16〗。欲吾营私阿附，有犯死不能也！”","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":192,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ce3329711a4ddcc33a21","layer":"original","quote":"沛相陈珪举孝廉〖3〗，太尉黄琬辟〖4〗；皆不就","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-0ea390afd2c83caa18a9","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-fe60abe324d40d59e61e","layer":"pei","quote":"布进军，去勋等营百步，暹、奉兵同时并发。斩十将首，杀伤堕水死者不可胜数","attribution":"裴注·九州春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a7ab9de04a39324dfeda","start":119,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-506be56448dd0eb5ba0f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-0d0502753fa2cc2b8a39","layer":"original","quote":"即增珪秩中二千石〖6〗，拜登广陵太守。临别，太祖执登手曰：“东方之事，便以相付！”令登阴合部众，以为内应","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-62f6f06678aca807f40c","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-fe60abe324d40d59e61e","layer":"pei","quote":"布与暹、奉书曰：‘二将军拔大驾来东，有元功于国；当书勋竹帛，万世不朽。今袁术造逆，当共诛讨，奈何与贼臣还共伐布？布有杀董卓之功，与二将军俱为功臣；可因今共击破术，建功于天下，此时不可失也！’暹、奉得书，即回计从布","attribution":"裴注·九州春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a7ab9de04a39324dfeda","start":12,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-83871ae5a3e2d38ce98e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-622ce819aba6e14407e5","layer":"pei","quote":"奉使到许，太祖以登为广陵太守，令阴合众以图吕布","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6729e3e0dee949511712","start":117,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-8c16a5237fcdeea47140","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-0c7981b3fdfd16298529","layer":"original","quote":"布谓珪曰：“今致术军，卿之由也。为之奈何？”珪曰：“暹、奉与术，猝合之军耳！策谋不素定，不能相维持。子登策之，比之连鸡〖1〗：势不俱栖，可解离也。”布用珪策，遣人说暹、奉，使与己并力共击术军；军资所有，悉许暹、奉。于是暹、奉从之，勋大破败","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-98215ad785aa14260dec","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-b0d919db1b39956835bf","layer":"original","quote":"珪欲使子登诣太祖，布不肯遣","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-b28024c27d38f4099607","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-49c0756a0d77f60a585f","layer":"original","quote":"沛相陈珪恐术、布成婚，则徐、扬合从〖1〗，将为国难〖2〗。于是往说布曰：“曹公奉迎天子，辅赞国政；威灵命世，将征四海；将军宜与协同策谋，图泰山之安。今与术结婚，受天下不义之名，必有累卵之危！”布亦怨术初不己受也〖3〗，女已在途，追还绝婚；械送韩胤〖4〗，枭首许市","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
